Value Required IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Required MAC ([0-9a-fA-F:]{17})
Value COUNT (\d+)
Value LEN (\d+)
Value VENDOR (.+)

Start
  ^\s*${IP}\s+${MAC}\s+${COUNT}\s+${LEN}\s+${VENDOR} -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^Currently scanning: -> Next
  ^-- Active scan completed -> Next
  ^-- Ending netdiscover -> Next
  ^ERROR: -> Next
  ^.* -> Next

EOF
